  "details": "Open beta 1351 shows some localized strings that should not be localized right now (we, localization contributors, heard so).\n\nWe find two places. See the attached images.\n\n1. The section title of `MM > Settings > Comfort & Safety > Safety` (1st image)\n\n2. In the Camera UI, the focus parameters and the flying mode instructions (only in the case of VR mode) (2nd image)\n\nNote for the camera UI:\n\nIt seems not to reflect language selection immediately. To reproduce the issue, select a language and restart the app.\n\nAlso, it shows not-approved strings. See the Korean case (3rd, 4th image). I've reported not-approved strings issue here https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1351-showing-not-approved-tooltip )",
